(6514012, 968274, 129171, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Colours _just_ go together (for me) but I keep looking at it regardless. The little white lines separating the blue from the other colours just jump out and draw me right round the picture.</td>', 'I like this one. Colours _just_ go together (for me) but I keep looking at it regardless. The little white lines separating the blue from the other colours just jump out and draw me right round the picture.', '2011-08-24 07:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
