(6514014, 968912, 129171, '<td valign="top">This makes me feel like I know the creator a little, I imagine some lovingly homemade items of clothing.</td>', 'This makes me feel like I know the creator a little, I imagine some lovingly homemade items of clothing.', '2011-08-24 07:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514015, 968844, 129171, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, although I didn''t immediately notice it - a narrow portrait crop would make it possibly a ribbon winner for me (and the pencil sharperner/zipper pull also in focus).</td>', 'I like the idea, although I didn''t immediately notice it - a narrow portrait crop would make it possibly a ribbon winner for me (and the pencil sharperner/zipper pull also in focus).', '2011-08-24 07:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514016, 969131, 129171, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this is a 3 dimensional lampshade so I think it''s very nice that you''d given enough depth of field (nearly!) to make it look 2D, and the viewer can then look at the shapes to work backwards and figure out what it was. Making 2D from 3D - a nice reversal of convention.</td>', 'I''m guessing this is a 3 dimensional lampshade so I think it''s very nice that you''d given enough depth of field (nearly!) to make it look 2D, and the viewer can then look at the shapes to work backwards and figure out what it was. Making 2D from 3D - a nice reversal of convention.', '2011-08-24 07:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514017, 969074, 129171, '<td valign="top">Nice idea with the border.</td>', 'Nice idea with the border.', '2011-08-24 07:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514018, 968095, 129171, '<td valign="top">Brilliant composition, could maybe benefit from being a touch brighter/lighter?</td>', 'Brilliant composition, could maybe benefit from being a touch brighter/lighter?', '2011-08-24 07:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514023, 968335, 129171, '<td valign="top">Now I''m hungry for smarties :-)<br/> <br/>Was the white pencil on white background deliberate?</td>', 'Now I''m hungry for smarties :-) Was the white pencil on white background deliberate?', '2011-08-24 07:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514025, 969016, 129171, '<td valign="top">I like the specular highlights on the left, and the balance between that and the in focus bit on the right, and the gradual change of colour to the brass in the top right. Actually I didn''t like this much at first glance but it grew on me pretty quickly, just in the space of typing this.</td>', 'I like the specular highlights on the left, and the balance between that and the in focus bit on the right, and the gradual change of colour to the brass in the top right. Actually I didn''t like this much at first glance but it grew on me pretty quickly, just in the space of typing this.', '2011-08-24 07:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514026, 968495, 129171, '<td valign="top">Really cool! Looks like a natural scene at first, then you notice the pale leaves pretty quickly, then work your way around the rest of the picture. Lovely composition, works with the subtle light on the left half of the tree.</td>', 'Really cool! Looks like a natural scene at first, then you notice the pale leaves pretty quickly, then work your way around the rest of the picture. Lovely composition, works with the subtle light on the left half of the tree.', '2011-08-24 07:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514027, 968834, 129171, '<td valign="top">Lovely and sharp. The only think I''d change is move the camera left just a little, as the red is the most dominant so I feel it should be a teeny bit closer to the centre.</td>', 'Lovely and sharp. The only think I''d change is move the camera left just a little, as the red is the most dominant so I feel it should be a teeny bit closer to the centre.', '2011-08-24 07:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514028, 969127, 129171, '<td valign="top">Fabulous colours.</td>', 'Fabulous colours.', '2011-08-24 07:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514029, 969106, 129171, '<td valign="top">Simple yet effective. Curious what it is, the title gives no clues!</td>', 'Simple yet effective. Curious what it is, the title gives no clues!', '2011-08-24 07:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514030, 969110, 129171, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones, although would prefer it without the other one cluttering up the background.</td>', 'Lovely tones, although would prefer it without the other one cluttering up the background.', '2011-08-24 07:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514031, 969108, 129171, '<td valign="top">Now that is nice. I''d actually prefer it without the border though, or with a thinner one - the orange doesn''t seem to be quite the right colour so it detracts from the colours in the shot.</td>', 'Now that is nice. I''d actually prefer it without the border though, or with a thinner one - the orange doesn''t seem to be quite the right colour so it detracts from the colours in the shot.', '2011-08-24 07:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
