(6514153, 968601, 43774, '<td valign="top">Nice and colourful. A few suggestions for improvement - a whiter background &amp; even lighting. Also, shoot it fom above so it''s not on an angle. Center it perfectly and then it would be more like a Sherpet shot.</td>', 'Nice and colourful. A few suggestions for improvement - a whiter background & even lighting. Also, shoot it fom above so it''s not on an angle. Center it perfectly and then it would be more like a Sherpet shot.', '2011-08-24 09:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514158, 968844, 43774, '<td valign="top">I''ve done a similar shot like this and so have many others. Not knocking you for that though!<br/> <br/>Would have been better if you turned the pencils so we couldn''t see the writing on any of them. Right now it looks like a rushed job.<br/> <br/>A square crop would also be more like a Sherpet shot.</td>', 'I''ve done a similar shot like this and so have many others. Not knocking you for that though! Would have been better if you turned the pencils so we couldn''t see the writing on any of them. Right now it looks like a rushed job. A square crop would also be more like a Sherpet shot.', '2011-08-24 09:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514159, 968912, 43774, '<td valign="top">Definitely looks like something Sherpet would put together and shoot.</td>', 'Definitely looks like something Sherpet would put together and shoot.', '2011-08-24 09:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6514170, 969091, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is lovely -- beautiful colors, light, and clarity. I think it might be a little stronger if it were cropped square.</td>', 'This is lovely -- beautiful colors, light, and clarity. I think it might be a little stronger if it were cropped square.', '2011-08-24 09:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
