(6515883, 968937, 108580, '<td valign="top">Colourful and sharp DMC. Why the Lego or are those actually sweets too?<br/>Same frame and same rotation as <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=948391" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this entry</a>.<br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=968937" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1440/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_968937.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1440/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_968937.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1440/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_968937.jpg"/></a> <br/>:)<br/>Edit to fix thumbnail code.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-08-31 03:57:59.</i></td>', 'Colourful and sharp DMC. Why the Lego or are those actually sweets too?Same frame and same rotation as this entry. :)Edit to fix thumbnail code.', '2011-08-25 18:54:29.000000', '2011-08-31 04:57:59.000000', 1),
