(6517415, 968639, 66384, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous image. I love the contrast and the sweeping line of the stairs. Great perspective and rhythm. I wish this had been in the Free Study, because, I don''t recognize this as being the sort of image Sherpet would create. It seems too cold, both in subject matter and emotion.</td>', 'Gorgeous image. I love the contrast and the sweeping line of the stairs. Great perspective and rhythm. I wish this had been in the Free Study, because, I don''t recognize this as being the sort of image Sherpet would create. It seems too cold, both in subject matter and emotion.', '2011-08-27 13:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517419, 969066, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors. I think there is a stronger image inside this photo. I''d try cropping the left side severely (eliminating all the green there), and the bottom a little to create a square. This will make the light in the center of the blossom really pop.</td>', 'Lovely colors. I think there is a stronger image inside this photo. I''d try cropping the left side severely (eliminating all the green there), and the bottom a little to create a square. This will make the light in the center of the blossom really pop.', '2011-08-27 13:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517422, 969059, 66384, '<td valign="top">I love the bright sunny yellows, and the radiant composition. Beautiful curves too. You nailed this challenge.</td>', 'I love the bright sunny yellows, and the radiant composition. Beautiful curves too. You nailed this challenge.', '2011-08-27 13:11:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517428, 968912, 66384, '<td valign="top">Ah, this is totally Sherpet: the variety of materials, textures, and color; the careful construction, the squares, and the cheer. It makes me happy, as do Shez''s images.</td>', 'Ah, this is totally Sherpet: the variety of materials, textures, and color; the careful construction, the squares, and the cheer. It makes me happy, as do Shez''s images.', '2011-08-27 13:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517436, 968889, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the light, and that incredibly rich red. Ordinarily I''d say the border was competing with the subject for attention, but for this challenge, I think it''s appropriate.</td>', 'Love the light, and that incredibly rich red. Ordinarily I''d say the border was competing with the subject for attention, but for this challenge, I think it''s appropriate.', '2011-08-27 13:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6517440, 968493, 66384, '<td valign="top">Oh, look at the wonderful radiant symmetry and the colors in those petals. This is a beautiful example of Sherpet''s style. The flower is so amazing it doesn''t even need the bee..</td>', 'Oh, look at the wonderful radiant symmetry and the colors in those petals. This is a beautiful example of Sherpet''s style. The flower is so amazing it doesn''t even need the bee..', '2011-08-27 13:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
