(6517557, 968460, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice shades of green and texture. DOF may be a little too shallow, because I''m having a trouble finding a good resting place. The sharpest point seems to be the little water drop on the left.</td>', 'Nice shades of green and texture. DOF may be a little too shallow, because I''m having a trouble finding a good resting place. The sharpest point seems to be the little water drop on the left.', '2011-08-27 18:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
