(6517569, 968917, 66384, '<td valign="top">Well, you could have fooled me. I''d swear this was a Sherpet: the care with which it is constructed, the perfection of each exquisite blossom, the focus and light, the symmetry. Congratulations!</td>', 'Well, you could have fooled me. I''d swear this was a Sherpet: the care with which it is constructed, the perfection of each exquisite blossom, the focus and light, the symmetry. Congratulations!', '2011-08-27 18:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
