(6530408, 968639, 82545, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the great comments. I was out and about trying to find an open nursery to do some macro and couldn''t find any interesting plants to shoot. So as I was headed down the road I saw these oil towers, and I''ve always wanted a cool shot of them because I really like how powerful and gritty industrial photos can be. So I took a few and really like the way this one turned out. That''s the reason I do the DP challenge, as a way to force myself to get off my lazy butt and find things to collect with my camera.</td>', 'Thanks for all of the great comments. I was out and about trying to find an open nursery to do some macro and couldn''t find any interesting plants to shoot. So as I was headed down the road I saw these oil towers, and I''ve always wanted a cool shot of them because I really like how powerful and gritty industrial photos can be. So I took a few and really like the way this one turned out. That''s the reason I do the DP challenge, as a way to force myself to get off my lazy butt and find things to collect with my camera.', '2011-09-06 16:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
